  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="b91c-0847-96ef-5f4f" name="New Kingdom Egyptian (AoA2) - List Notes" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false">
      <description>ARMIES OF ANTIQUITY v2 #114 (unofficial, Martin Gibbins). The Egypt everyone remembers, covering the major wars against the Hittites and the sea peoples. Allies And Mercenaries: 0-1 unit M WS BS S T W I A Ld Pts Allies And Mercenaries: 0-1 Ne’arim Chariots 8 4 4 3 4 1 4 2 8 82 Allies And Mercenaries: Sherden Guard 5 4 3 3 3 1 3 1 8 14 Allies And Mercenaries: Sea Peoples 5 3 3 3 3 1 3 1 5 6 Allies And Mercenaries: Libyans &amp; Kushites 5 3 3 3 3 1 3 1 5 8 Allies And Mercenaries: Syrians 5 2 3 3 3 1 3 1 5 6 Allies And Mercenaries: Nubians 5 3 3 3 3 1 3 1 6 8 Allies And Mercenaries: Slingers 5 2 3 3 3 1 3 1 5 6 Allies And Mercenaries: Ne’arim Chariot have Driver and one crewman armed with hand weapon, bow, javelins, light armour and shield. Option: may have thrusting spears (+6 points). Light Chariots. Expert Horsemen. Allies And Mercenaries: Sherden Guard have Hand weapon and buckler. Option: may have javelins (+1 point) and light armour (+2 points). Stubborn. Allies And Mercenaries: Sea Peoples have Hand weapon, javelins and shield Option: May have light armour (+2 points). Warband (rule 2 does not apply) Allies And Mercenaries: Libyans &amp; Kushites Hand weapon and javelins. Light Infantry. Warband (rule 2 does not apply) Allies And Mercenaries: Syrians Hand weapon and javelins. Option: May have short bows (+1 point) or bows (+2 point). Light Infantry. Allies And Mercenaries: Numbians Hand weapon and short bow. Skirmishers. Allies And Mercenaries: Slingers Hand weapon and sling. Option: May have buckler (free) Skirmishers.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[New Kingdom Egyptian]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Chariots and Cavalry: up to 40%
  Infantry: at least 25%
  Characters: up to 25% Chariots and Cavalry: up to 40% Infantry: At least 25% Allies &amp; Mercenaries: up to 25%</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
